\p \v 4 \w Day|strong="H3117"\w* \w after day|strong="H3117"\w* \w they warned|strong="H559"\w* \w him|strong="H413"\w*, \w but he would not|strong="H3808"\w* \w comply|strong="H8085"\w*. \w So they reported it|strong="H5046"\w* \w to Haman|strong="H2001"\w* \w to see|strong="H7200"\w* \w whether Mordecai’s|strong="H4782"\w* \w behavior|strong="H1697"\w* \w would be tolerated|strong="H5975"\w*, \w since|strong="H3588"\w* \w he had told|strong="H5046"\w* \w them|strong="H834"\w* \w he|strong="H1931"\w* \w was a Jew|strong="H3064"\w*.
